{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Rich World Full of Personality</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore seamlessly connected and large procedurally generated levels, each with their own style of building. No one knows what you might find, and every run is so different from the last!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create Your Playstyle!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are sooo many ways to mix and match the expansive arsenal of items, weapons, and trinkets that you find. You can build a unique experience that perfectly fits you!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Conquer The Great Aerlysia</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each zone has its own story and lore to tell, and it\u2019s up to you to discover it. Venture from room to room, defeat all adversaries along the way, and ultimately reclaim what was once yours\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1947220/extras/ef37b404942fe56960d89737959680a6.poster.avif?t=1758562602\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1947220/extras/ef37b404942fe56960d89737959680a6.webm?t=1758562602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1947220/extras/ef37b404942fe56960d89737959680a6.mp4?t=1758562602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of unique rooms, every run different from the last</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of enemies that pose different challenges to the player, learn and overcome each one</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize a large amount of customization from dozens of items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A highly energetic and fun soundtrack!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026Secrets? Wait-what? ??</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1947220?t=1758562602","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1947220?t=1758562602","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1947220/fb1bb5390fbdfee4b763a9170d7778eac661392e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758562602","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1947220/fb1bb5390fbdfee4b763a9170d7778eac661392e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758562602","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3160780,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Rich World Full of Personality</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore seamlessly connected and large procedurally generated levels, each with their own style of building. No one knows what you might find, and every run is so different from the last!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create Your Playstyle!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are sooo many ways to mix and match the expansive arsenal of items, weapons, and trinkets that you find. You can build a unique experience that perfectly fits you!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Conquer The Great Aerlysia</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each zone has its own story and lore to tell, and it\u2019s up to you to discover it. Venture from room to room, defeat all adversaries along the way, and ultimately reclaim what was once yours\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1947220/extras/ef37b404942fe56